SENSOR BASED TECHNIQUE:

-Gesture Detection based on flex sensors.
-Real-Time Translation.

VIDEO INTERCOM:

-For visual communication.
-Live Translation during video calls.

METHODOLOGY AND IMPLEMENTATION:

 -Flex sensors and accelerometers on a glove detect hand movements and send data to the Arduino UNO for gesture recognition.
 -The system outputs corresponding audio and text via speakers and an LCD screen based on predefined gesture patterns.
